      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 104: 🔴 The checksum input format passed to `sha256sum -c -` is invalid (`echo -n ${QT_WEBENGINE_TARBALL_CHECKSUM} \"$QT_WEBENGINE_TARBALL_FILE_NAME\"` produces a single separator space and no guaranteed record terminator). `sha256sum -c` expects `HASH␠␠FILENAME` (or `HASH␠*FILENAME`), so this can fail with ‘improperly formatted checksum line’ and abort RPM builds. Build the line explicitly with two spaces and a newline, e.g. `printf \u0027%s  %s\\n\u0027 \"$QT_WEBENGINE_TARBALL_CHECKSUM\" \"$QT_WEBENGINE_TARBALL_FILE_NAME\" | sha256sum -c -`.",
      "revId": "3f2bbcd5ba9030c8bbf715f4d5afb2903d67e550",
